  "description": "Programmatic Word document sections for EVM reporting. Each IWordDocSection adds a section to a Syncfusion.DocIO WordDocument. Pairs with Cayaqui.MPS.PptExport, Cayaqui.MPS.ExcelExport, and Cayaqui.MPS.ReportModels.",
